    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SealChain is a roguelike game where items can link together to form chain reactions. Items can also be arranged into specific formations to create seals, granting special effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is falling apart. Chaotic evil shrouds the land like a dense purple fog. In this catastrophe, countless innocent beings have turned into cursed monsters. There is no savior here. Ancient sorcery is reviving, empowering the &quot;Mediums&quot;. With the power of seals, cleanse the end-time evils.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652600/extras/9357beb6425a81c8c64286046aeca66a.avif?t=1754616486\" data-has-big width=800 height=422 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Items can link together to form chain reactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Items can be arranged into specific formations to create seals, granting special effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Event system that provides various items through randomly triggered events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A wide variety of items, classes, monsters, and events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Different rewards from various NPCs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Items can be stacked infinitely</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unlimited combat power for exponential excitement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Endless mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Easy-to-create MODs, allowing you to create items, monsters, characters, and events without programming knowledge</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >When the items are linked together, they will form a seal.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652600/extras/0c623ff64a7c701f0d301f8bc08b066c.poster.avif?t=1754616486\" width=386 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652600/extras/0c623ff64a7c701f0d301f8bc08b066c.webm?t=1754616486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652600/extras/0c623ff64a7c701f0d301f8bc08b066c.mp4?t=1754616486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Brisk combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652600/extras/7c053e7f1a163d92ff0400c0f86b6766.poster.avif?t=1754616486\" width=486 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652600/extras/7c053e7f1a163d92ff0400c0f86b6766.webm?t=1754616486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652600/extras/7c053e7f1a163d92ff0400c0f86b6766.mp4?t=1754616486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
